1
00:00:13,206 --> 00:00:18,339
By the fire at night, beneath an enormous moon,

2
00:00:18,609 --> 00:00:24,041
The dark forest sheltered us with green leaves.

3
00:00:24,132 --> 00:00:29,424
I kissed you by the fire that night.

4
00:00:29,714 --> 00:00:40,089
I gave you half of myself.

5
00:01:02,582 --> 00:01:07,635
Light from a distant star, birdsong until dawn.

6
00:01:08,225 --> 00:01:13,418
You looked into my eyes and whispered words.

7
00:01:13,789 --> 00:01:19,022
You didn’t believe me, but you loved me.

8
00:01:19,312 --> 00:01:29,688
I left half of myself with you.

9
00:01:52,382 --> 00:01:57,615
What’s past is forgotten; what’s past is gone.

10
00:01:57,905 --> 00:02:03,298
You waved a turquoise scarf as I left.

11
00:02:03,408 --> 00:02:08,641
I kissed you by the fire that night.

12
00:02:08,912 --> 00:02:19,348
You left me half of myself.
